          "panel_number": 2,
          "texts": [
            {
              "kind": "caption",
              "text": "I sought the landlord for a room, and being told the house was full, I consented—if the harpooneer were not decidedly objectionable—to share a blanket rather than wander further on so bitter a night.",
              "caption_zone": "bottom_center"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "speaker": "Peter Coffin",
              "text": "You haint no objections to sharing a harpooneer’s blanket, have ye?",
              "balloon_zone": "top_right",
              "speaker_region": "right",
              "source_evidence": "“you haint no objections to sharing a harpooneer’s blanket, have ye?”"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_number": 2,
      "panels": [
        {
          "panel_number": 3,
          "texts": [
            {
              "kind": "caption",
              "text": "I tried making up the bench, but knots, cold, and draughts defeated me.",
              "caption_zone": "top_right"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "speaker": "Ishmael",
              "text": "I’ve changed my mind—I shan’t sleep with him. I’ll try the bench.",
              "balloon_zone": "top_left",
              "speaker_region": "left",
              "source_evidence": "“I’ve changed my mind about that harpooneer.—I shan’t sleep with him. I’ll try the bench here.”"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_number": 4,
      "panels": [
        {
          "panel_number": 5,
          "texts": [
            {
              "kind": "caption",
              "text": "Seeing it was Sunday and he’d come to anchor elsewhere, I let the landlord lead me to the prodigious bed; I eyed the room and the harpooneer’s outlandish gear, then turned in.",
              "caption_zone": "top_center"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "speaker": "Peter Coffin",
              "text": "Make yourself comfortable now, and good night to ye.",
              "balloon_zone": "bottom_right",
              "speaker_region": "right",
              "source_evidence": "“there, make yourself comfortable now, and good night to ye.”"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_number": 5,
      "panels": [
        {
          "panel_number": 7,
          "texts": [
            {
              "kind": "caption",
              "text": "He sprang into bed; I cried out; the landlord burst in with a light.",
              "caption_zone": "bottom_center"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "speaker": "Queequeg",
              "text": "Who-e debel you? You no speak-e—dam-me, I kill-e!",
              "balloon_zone": "top_left",
              "speaker_region": "left",
              "source_evidence": "“Who-e debel you?—you no speak-e, dam-me, I kill-e.”"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "speaker": "Peter Coffin",
              "text": "Don’t be afraid now—Queequeg won’t harm a hair of your head.",
              "balloon_zone": "top_right",
              "speaker_region": "right",
              "source_evidence": "“Don’t be afraid now… Queequeg here wouldn’t harm a hair of your head.”"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "panel_number": 8,
          "texts": [
            {
              "kind": "caption",
              "text": "He stashed the tomahawk-pipe; I turned in and slept soundly.",
              "caption_zone": "bottom_center"
            },
            {
              "kind": "thought",
              "speaker": "Ishmael",
              "text": "Better sleep with a sober cannibal than a drunken Christian.",
              "balloon_zone": "top_left",
              "speaker_region": "left",
              "source_evidence": "“Better sleep with a sober cannibal than a drunken Christian.”"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_number": 6,
      "panels": [
        {
          "panel_number": 2,
          "texts": [
            {
              "kind": "caption",
              "text": "I wriggled free, rolled, felt a scratch, and threw back the quilt to find his tomahawk-pipe.",
              "caption_zone": "bottom_center"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "speaker": "Ishmael",
              "text": "Queequeg! In the name of goodness, wake!",
              "balloon_zone": "top_left",
              "speaker_region": "left",
              "source_evidence": "“Queequeg!—in the name of goodness, Queequeg, wake!”"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_number": 8,
      "panels": [
        {
          "panel_number": 6,
          "texts": [
            {
              "kind": "caption",
              "text": "He complied, then washed only his chest, arms, and hands.",
              "caption_zone": "bottom_center"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "speaker": "Ishmael",
              "text": "Get into your pantaloons as soon as possible.",
              "balloon_zone": "top_left",
              "speaker_region": "left",
              "source_evidence": "“I begged him… to accelerate his toilet… particularly to get into his pantaloons as soon as possible.”"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
